                  </cell>
                  <cell>
                     <p>THE MISER</p>
                     <p>DR. KEY'S ANSWER</p>
                     <p>THE CHASE</p>
                     <p>A RISING DOCTOR</p>
                     <p>THE SAILOR BOLD</p>
                     <p>OVERHEARD IN THE CORN-FIELD</p>
                  </cell>
                  <cell>
                     <p>TWINS</p>
                     <p>A SHARP LOVER</p>
                     <p>THE GREEDY LITTLE PITCHERS</p>
                     <p>OBLIGING MR. HAMMER</p>
